      ],
      "content": "1. 839                                           GOSSOMS END                                              1.                                            No 59 (Gossom's Lodge)  839                                           (Formerly listed as                                               No 14                                                                                            SP 9808 SW 5/13            29.7.50.              II 2. C16 or early C17 structure with front altered in C18 Gothic style and later. Stucco ground floor, C19 tile hanging to 1st floor, tiled roof.  2 storeys, 3 sashes with pointed arched glazing bars.  Central closed porch doorway  and side windows.  Early chimneystack has square base to cylindrical shaft with spiral mouldings, Listing NGR: SP9837208264"
